I did the obvious thing for debugging:  broke your complicated
loop into its pieces and tested them independently.

You can't take a negative number to a fractional power.

So the "valid_inputs" are not valid in that case.

Also, you need to reset memory in between calls to grad() if you
hope to get the right results (see how the gradient() functional
does it).

- Bob

